{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17570","headline":"和段相公登武担寺西台 · 姚康","name":"和段相公登武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松迳引清风，登台古寺中。\n江平沙岸白，日下锦川红。\n疎树山根净，深云鸟迹穷。\n自惭陪末席，便与九霄通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚康","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}